  "description": "ASP.NET Core integration for Vali-Mediator. Maps Result<T> and Result to HTTP responses:\n      Ok→200, Validation→400, NotFound→404, Conflict→409, Unauthorized→401, Forbidden→403, Failure→500.\n      Provides ToActionResult() for MVC controllers and ToHttpResult() for Minimal API.",
